<h1>Durga Sir Core Java notes</h1>
<p>Detailed study notes from the YouTube playlist</p>
<p>java tutorial by durga sir</p>
<p>(Core Java with OCJP/SCJP, Durga Software Solutions).</p>
<ul><li>203 videos, about 234 hours 37 minutes total</li></ul>
<ul><li>One markdown file per video</li></ul>
<ul><li>Worked in 20-video chunks so nothing is skipped</li></ul>
<ul><li>Every file starts with title + video info, then the notes</li></ul>
<h2>How to read a note</h2>
<p>Each video file has this shape:</p>
<ol><li>Video info — full title, playlist position, series/part, topic, instructor, duration, YouTube URL</li></ol>
<ol><li>What this lecture covers — agenda</li></ol>
<ol><li>Detailed notes — timestamped sections, rules, examples, exam traps</li></ol>
<ol><li>Code from the lecture — reconstructed Java as written on the board</li></ol>
<ol><li>Exam / interview points — what Durga Sir flags as important</li></ol>
<h2>Chunks</h2>
<p>Full list with links: 00-playlist-index.md</p>
